  "details": "version w_ 2019.2.1p1\n(From earlier)\nI use desktop mode, but I think that the same thing happens with VR and controller in terms of turning specifications.\n\nUp until now, I thought it was an acceleration issue but it seems different.\nApparently, the frame rate changes the turning sensitivity itself in the  horizontal turning.\n(That is, 60 becomes 1 and 30 becomes 2)\nThis problem is noticeable when using a mouse on the desktop, but I think that it can be realized when comfort turning is turned off also in VR and controller.i",
